  "prefLabel": "Plc 1004.06 Jurisprudence Examination Fee for Dentists and Dental Hygienists",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1004.06 Jurisprudence Examination Fee for Dentists and Dental Hygienists. The fee for the jurisprudence examination for dentists and dental hygienists as regulated by the board of dental examiners under RSA 317‑A shall be $69.\n\nSource. #14244, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14377, eff 10-8-25, EXPIRES: 10-8-35 (formerly Plc 1004.05)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
